episodes.description:
Happy radio lads! Don’t mind if I do.
No Ed? And no Rhys too? No problem – Matthew made sure he wasn’t flying solo by booking some of the best names in the biz. On this show: Josh Widdicombe, Alex Horne, Fern Brady, Joel Dommett, Harry Hill, plus a sneaky appearance from Stuart Laws and Ed Gamble himself.
Thanks for downloading the podcast – remember, you can be an Early Worm and catch the show live on Radio X every Sunday 8am – 11am.
Get in touch on sunday@radiox.co.uk
